/// Operator-side personal identity for users who run (own / maintain) an
/// Organization. Mirrors StaffProfile / AdminProfile: one row per User,
/// minimal by design, extensible later with operator-only preferences
/// (default notification channel, org-switcher pinned order, etc.).
///
/// Created inside POST /api/organizations when a user creates their first
/// org, and surfaced to the UI via user.orgWorkspaceProfileId. The
/// "Personal Dashboard" link in the org sidebar resolves here first
/// (priority order: orgWorkspace > consultant > consultee), so an org-owner
/// no longer gets routed into the consumer ConsulteeProfile surface by
/// default.
